<title>RUSSIA: Russia MT Index adds Samarenergo, Volgotanker.</title>
<headline>Russia MT Index adds Samarenergo, Volgotanker.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moscow Times Russian shares Index will add utility AO Samarenergo and shipping company AO Volgotanker and delist Mosbusinessbank and aircraft maker AO Aviastar on September 16, Skate Agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>Skate, which prepares the index of 50 leading shares, said in a statement that the index's advisory board had decided not to restore natural gas monopoly AO Gazprom, which was removed from the index in 1995.</p>
<p>Gazprom company rules strictly regulate the buying and selling of its shares, limiting liquidity.</p>
<p>--Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
